window.docContents[152].resolve({"/Basic-Types/Strings/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Strings--API-Reference--Raw-Substrings--Comparisons":{"contents":"Checks whether two substrings represent equal strings. Usually accessed via the == operator.Two substrings do not need to have the same underlying string or the same start and end positions;\ninstead, they are equal if they contain the same sequence of characters.\n\nChecks whether two substrings have the same position and content.The two substrings do not need to have the same underlying string for this check to succeed.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Strings\u0009API Reference\u0009Raw Substrings","header":"20.8.4.12.4. Comparisons","id":"/Basic-Types/Strings/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Strings--API-Reference--Raw-Substrings--Comparisons"},"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Lake/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Build-Tools-and-Distribution--Lake--Command-Line-Interface--Development-Tools--Scripts":{"contents":"\n\n\n\n列出工作区中可用的脚本。\n\n\n\n此命令运行工作区（或特定 package）的 script，\n并将 args 传递给它。单独的 run 命令将运行根包的默认脚本（没有参数）。\n\n打印 script 的文档注释。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009构建工具\u0009Lake\u0009命令行界面\u0009开发工具","header":"24.1.2.8.2. 脚本","id":"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Lake/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Build-Tools-and-Distribution--Lake--Command-Line-Interface--Development-Tools--Scripts"},"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Managing-Toolchains-with-Elan/#elan-toolchain-versions":{"contents":"使用 Elan 时，PATH 中每个工具的版本都是一个调用正确版本的代理。\n代理会为当前上下文确定适当的工具链版本，确保该版本已安装，然后调用相应工具链安装中的底层工具。\n可以传入以 + 为前缀的参数，指示这些代理使用特定版本；因此 lake +4.0.0 会调用 4.0.0 版的 lake，必要时先安装它。\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009构建工具\u0009Elan","header":"24.2.1. 选择工具链","id":"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Managing-Toolchains-with-Elan/#elan-toolchain-versions"}});